; A lot bought at a fixated cost, `10 AAPL @ =$5`, is the lot
; {=$5} [2020/01/01], and a posting that names a lot names exactly that
; lot: {$5} [2020/01/01] is another one, the "=" marker being part of a
; lot's identity (#1454).  Assets:Broker:Exact sells its lot as
; {=$5} [2020/01/01] and ends empty.  Assets:Broker:Floating sells
; `-10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ $6`, and Assets:Broker:FixatedSale the
; same at a fixated price, `@ =$6`: each names the floating lot, which it
; does not hold, so each keeps its {=$5} lot and goes 10 short in the {$5}
; one; bal nets the two to 0 AAPL, --lots shows both, and -V values the
; pair at $50 - $70 = $-20.  A purchase that names its lot at a fixated
; cost, `10 AAPL {$5} @ =$5`, buys into the lot it names, the floating
; {$5}, since `@ =price` fixates only a lot it creates: Assets:Broker:Named
; holds 10 AAPL {$5}, and -V values it at the later $7 price, $70.
;
; 3.4.1 closed the Floating and FixatedSale sales and fixated Named's lot
; by setting the fixated flag on the lot {$5} [2020/01/01] itself whenever
; a cost was fixated, which made the two spellings one lot for every
; account that held either (lot-fixated-cost-neighbour.test shows what
; that did to the other holders).

P 2020/03/01 AAPL $7

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker:Exact          10 AAPL @ =$5
    Assets:Cash

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker:Floating       10 AAPL @ =$5
    Assets:Cash

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker:FixatedSale    10 AAPL @ =$5
    Assets:Cash

2020/01/01 Buy, naming the lot
    Assets:Broker:Named          10 AAPL {$5} @ =$5
    Assets:Cash

2020/02/01 Sell as {=$5}
    Assets:Broker:Exact         -10 AAPL {=$5} [2020/01/01] @ $6
    Assets:Cash                  $60
    Income:Gains

2020/02/01 Sell as {$5}
    Assets:Broker:Floating      -10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ $6
    Assets:Cash                  $60
    Income:Gains

2020/02/01 Sell as {$5} at a fixated price
    Assets:Broker:FixatedSale   -10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ =$6
    Assets:Cash                  $60
    Income:Gains

test bal --lots --flat --no-total --empty Assets:Broker
                   0  Assets:Broker:Exact
-10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01]
10 AAPL {=$5} [2020/01/01]  Assets:Broker:FixatedSale
-10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01]
10 AAPL {=$5} [2020/01/01]  Assets:Broker:Floating
        10 AAPL {$5}  Assets:Broker:Named
end test

test bal --flat --no-total --empty Assets:Broker
                   0  Assets:Broker:Exact
                   0  Assets:Broker:FixatedSale
                   0  Assets:Broker:Floating
             10 AAPL  Assets:Broker:Named
end test

test bal -V --flat --no-total --empty Assets:Broker
                   0  Assets:Broker:Exact
                $-20  Assets:Broker:FixatedSale
                $-20  Assets:Broker:Floating
                 $70  Assets:Broker:Named
end test
